    rdfs:comment "0.30.0 (2026-10-14): closedAtCommit of the Backlog stage output of the second lineage set to the commit that closed it."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.29.0 (2026-10-14): second lineage, Backlog stage closed: the first lineage's out-scoped work is admitted (0 admitted stories of chapters 5-7 recorded Done with bridge-verified evidence; admitted still open: ST_Deck_Ch05, ST_Research_Ch05, ST_Page_Ch05, ST_Deck_Ch06, ST_Research_Ch06, ST_Page_Ch06, ST_Deck_Ch07, ST_Research_Ch07, ST_Page_Ch07; chapters 8-14 admitted open, to be planned; the three epics and the initiative carried unchanged). Chapter checks that FAILED when the bridge ran them: ST_Deck_Ch05, ST_Research_Ch05, ST_Research_Ch06, ST_Page_Ch06, ST_Research_Ch07. Chapter checks that passed but whose story stays open because the research it depends on is not Done: ST_Page_Ch05, ST_Deck_Ch06, ST_Deck_Ch07, ST_Page_Ch07."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "0.28.0 (2026-10-14): second lineage, Objective stage closed."@en ;
