    backlog:hasDeliverableText "The three research runs (chapters 5 to 7) are recorded Done, each with its real finish date from git and evidence that was run again and verified against the course repository; one whose check fails stays open and is carried in unfinished." ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area2_Admission ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .

