ex:ST_Research_Ch13 backlog:hasAuditNote "Agent-reported disclosures for the chapter 13 research (from the course coordinator's relay of the research run's report, not re-verified here): 77 sources, 25 findings, 46 leaves, 58 checks with 0 mismatches; no Stage-4 artefact; NOT EXECUTED: a hardware signing device, a true air gap, paper and metal backups, an exchange hack, estate planning, mainnet funds, Shamir/SLIP39 in a wallet, BIP39 recovery in Core, a GPG signature check, BIP324 on the wire; two Flickr photos are cited with account names only. The check run here covers pipeline gates, executed corpus claims, the verify script and HermiT consistency." .
