    backlog:hasScoreRationale "WSJF = (business value 13 + time criticality 20 + risk reduction 13) / job size 3, Components reused from the same kind of story in chapters 1 and 2, whose scores the owner approved; they were not approved again for this story, so they are a proposal to the owner (L-116), not an approval. Time criticality is set by the next class, 09:00 Istanbul on Friday 2026-11-27, itself a proposal (see Iter_10)." .
